                  "value": "Data and materials supporting the paper: \"Evaluation of a schoolyard intervention to increase social inclusion of children with disabilities in one mainstream school. We compared 2 baseline assessments with 4 intervention assessments. Our quantitative data were based on wearable sensors, schoolyard observations, peer nominations and self-reports.\""
